================================================================

Run:

git status --short
git log -30 --oneline
git tag --sort=-version:refname | head -30

python -m pytest -q -ra
python main.py --version
python -m build
git diff --check

Inspect:

engineering_models.py
engineering_store_interface.py
SQLiteEngineeringStore
PostgresEngineeringStore
engineering_orchestrator.py
agent_runtime.py
control_plane.py
github_orchestrator.py
release_gate.py
tests/

Produce:

