================================================================
133. BULK APPROVAL
================================================================

Do not implement unrestricted "approve all".

If batch approval exists:

bind exact task/action hashes.

================================================================
134. SECURITY
================================================================

Audit:

repository path
remote URL
task source
campaign query
branch naming
operation journal
lease/fencing
tenant scoping
worker impersonation
API authorization
MCP
secrets

================================================================
135. TENANT ISOLATION
================================================================

Portfolio, repositories, campaigns and fleet task metadata must be
organization scoped under SaaS/multi-tenant mode.

================================================================
136. RLS
================================================================

Add real RLS policies for tenant-owned portfolio/fleet tables.

Test with actual application role.

================================================================
137. WORKER AUTHENTICATION
================================================================

Multi-host workers require authenticated identity.

Do not trust arbitrary worker_id from request body.

For local single-host mode, use appropriate local trust boundary.

================================================================
138. WORKER CAPABILITY TRUST
================================================================

Capabilities should derive from trusted registration/attestation config,
not task payload.

================================================================
139. FLEET SECRET DISTRIBUTION
================================================================

Workers receive only required SecretRef scope.

No global secret dump.

================================================================
140. REPOSITORY CREDENTIALS
================================================================

Git credentials scoped per repository/provider.

================================================================
141. NO CROSS-REPO SECRET LEAK
================================================================

Task for Repo A cannot receive Repo B credentials.

================================================================
142. LOCAL MODEL CONTEXT ISOLATION
================================================================

Shared local model weights okay.

Prompt/context remains task/repository scoped.

