================================================================
184. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-22 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-21 claims are truth-audited
[ ] real subprocess restart is tested
[ ] hard crash is tested
[ ] SQLite persists across separate processes
[ ] PostgreSQL backend is executed if distributed fleet claimed
[ ] PostgreSQL multi-process claims produce zero duplicates
[ ] stale worker fencing is real
[ ] actual Git repository is exercised
[ ] actual git worktree is exercised
[ ] actual validator fail->pass is executed
[ ] actual commit is created
[ ] actual local remote push is executed
[ ] commit/push UNKNOWN states reconcile
[ ] durable operation journal exists
[ ] repository portfolio exists
[ ] repository health is evidence-based
[ ] campaign scope is snapshotted
[ ] campaign tasks are idempotent
[ ] campaign restart works
[ ] canary rollout works
[ ] circuit breaker works
[ ] portfolio scheduler is fair
[ ] interactive jobs are not starved
[ ] fleet workers are durably registered
[ ] worker crash recovery works
[ ] local inference capacity constrains dispatch
[ ] per-repository concurrency is bounded
[ ] no campaign bypasses tool/security/cost policy
[ ] repository secrets are isolated
[ ] tenant fleet isolation passes
[ ] no Redis/Kafka/cloud dependency is introduced
[ ] zero-cost fleet mode makes zero paid calls
[ ] real model/GitHub/Web evidence remains separately classified
[ ] inherited RLS/security gates remain green

